      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demonstration only\n\nThe production MCP workflow manages authenticated calendar and booking operations.\n\nConceptual actions:\n- Check availability\n- Create booking\n- List future bookings\n- Reschedule booking\n- Cancel booking\n\nCalendar IDs, room names, table IDs, event IDs, credentials and business rules are not published.",
